==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
As part of the "[[Inner Knowing]]" [[Quest]], the [[Warrior]]s are instructed to make an offering to the Spring of Wisdom.<ref name="Gallery"/> This offering includes 10 [[Stamella Shroom]]s, 10 [[Restless Cricket]]s, 10 [[Staminoka Bass]]es, 10 [[Energetic Rhino Beetle]]s, and five [[Courser Bee Honey]]s. Once the offering has been made, a mysterious power will improve the Warriors' ability to execute [[Special Attack]]s.<ref>{{Cite|With a prayer and an offering to the Spring of Wisdom, you felt a mysterious power welling up inside you, making it easier to execute special attacks.|Gallery (Interface)|AoC}}</ref>
{{Noncanon|End}}

==Nomenclature==
The Spring of Wisdom is named after the [[Triforce of Wisdom]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 351}}</ref>
